# Cache rules for static hosts that read a _headers file (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages).
# The pages, code and demo library revalidate on every load so a deploy is picked
# up at once and a browser never mixes old and new ES modules.
#
# yappertech.com does not read this file — its equivalent lives in the monorepo's
# scripts/deploy.sh and scripts/release.sh, which exclude legal-ai-demo/* from the
# year-long immutable sync for exactly the same reason.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/js/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/css/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/demo/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
